  - _id: Goblins
    _name: Goblin Den
    _description: Goblins with sharp sticks and sharper ideas about your stores.
    _flavour: They tunnel under the yards and come up where the tools are. Nothing
      heavy is safe.
    _anchor: {x: -15, y: 20}
    _size: 2
    _tier: 3
    _radius: 2
    _sight: 3
