  - _id: Drake
    _name: Drake's Lair
    _description: A drake asleep on a hoard it means to make larger.
    _flavour: It sleeps on a hill of gold and wakes hungry for more. The treasury
      is its larder.
    _anchor: {x: -15, y: -15}
    _size: 2
    _tier: 5
    _radius: 3
    _sight: 4
